## Oracle Audit Checklist

- [ ] Are spot prices (AMM reserves) used for critical operations?
- [ ] Is oracle data validated for staleness?
- [ ] Are oracle decimals handled correctly?
- [ ] Is there protection against TWAP manipulation (>30 min window)?
- [ ] Are there fallback oracles for DoS protection?
- [ ] Is LP token pricing manipulation-resistant?
- [ ] Is virtual_price used safely (no read-only reentrancy)?
- [ ] Are derived assets priced correctly (stETH, wrapped tokens)?
- [ ] On L2: Is sequencer uptime checked?
- [ ] Are multiple price sources compared for deviation?
